# Detect text files and store them LF-normalized in the repository.
#
# eol=lf additionally checks them out as LF on every platform, overriding a
# user's core.autocrlf. Without it, a Windows checkout gets CRLF working files
# while the repository holds LF, and prettier — configured with endOfLine: "lf"
# — then rejects every line of every file it is pointed at.
#
# Binary files are still detected by text=auto and left untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
